#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`mutex` --- mutex module"
msgstr ":mod:`mutex` --- módulo mutex"

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``mutex`` module provides a mutual-exclusion primitive for protecting "
"critical sections of code or shared data from concurrent access by an "
"interrupt service routine and the main thread."
msgstr ""
"El módulo ``mutex`` proporciona una primitiva de exclusión mutua para "
"proteger secciones críticas de código o datos compartidos del acceso "
"concurrente por parte de una rutina de servicio de interrupción y el hilo "
"principal."

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:11
msgid ""
"Lock acquisition and release is performed via a context manager (``with`` "
"statement), which blocks until the mutex is available. A non-blocking "
":meth:`Mutex.test` method is also provided."
msgstr ""
"La adquisición y liberación del bloqueo se realiza mediante un gestor de "
"contexto (sentencia ``with``), que se bloquea hasta que el mutex esté "
"disponible. También se proporciona un método :meth:`Mutex.test` no "
"bloqueante."

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:15
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Ejemplo::"

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:36
msgid "class Mutex -- mutex object"
msgstr "class Mutex -- objeto mutex"

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:40
msgid "Creates an unlocked mutex object."
msgstr "Crea un objeto mutex desbloqueado."

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:44
msgid ""
"Unlock the mutex. Raises `mutex.MutexException` if the mutex is not "
"currently locked."
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea el mutex. Lanza `mutex.MutexException` si el mutex no está "
"bloqueado actualmente."

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:49
msgid ""
"Try to acquire the mutex in a non-blocking way. Returns ``True`` on success "
"and ``False`` if the mutex is already locked."
msgstr ""
"Intenta adquirir el mutex de forma no bloqueante. Devuelve ``True`` si tiene"
" éxito y ``False`` si el mutex ya está bloqueado."

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:52
msgid ""
"To acquire the mutex in a blocking way, use the instance as a context "
"manager (``with`` statement). The mutex is released automatically on exit."
msgstr ""
"Para adquirir el mutex de forma bloqueante, utiliza la instancia como gestor"
" de contexto (sentencia ``with``). El mutex se libera automáticamente al "
"salir."

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:56
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Excepciones"

#: ../../library/omv.mutex.rst:60
msgid ""
"Subclass of ``OSError``. Raised by `Mutex.release` when the mutex is already"
" unlocked."
msgstr ""
"Subclase de ``OSError``. La lanza `Mutex.release` cuando el mutex ya está "
"desbloqueado."
